el’s life far beyond his own awareness.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"Two young men during World War I set out to record the lives, voices and music of their American countrymen.\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"0000000002\",\"censorRatingNote\":{\"text\":\"brief strong sex\",\"translations\":[]},\"releaseDate\":\"2026-01-23\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":128,\"trailerUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=E2PSkw8BI7k\",\"displayPriority\":50,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000004598\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000007165\",\"roles\":[\"Director\",\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000007355\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000010579\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000010990\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017135\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017136\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017137\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017138\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017139\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017140\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017141\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000224\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000009\",\"0000000018\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"5916d744-923e-430d-9c44-1892f33b6e58\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00008082\",\"hoCode\":\"A000009167\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"UNIVERSAL PICTURES\"},{\"id\":\"HO00008101\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"Marty Supreme\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"Marty Mauser, a young man with a dream no one respects, goes to hell and back in pursuit of greatness.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"Marty Mauser, a young man with a dream no one respects, goes to hell and back in pursuit of greatness.\",\"translations\":[]},\"censo