\"The Rotunda\",\"line2\":\"Clarence Street\",\"city\":\"Kingston-upon-Thames\"}},\"ianaTimeZoneName\":\"Europe/London\"}],\"films\":[{\"id\":\"HO00007276\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"RBO Cinema Season 2025-26: Woolf Works\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"Virginia Woolf defied literary conventions to depict rich inner worlds – her heightened, startling and poignant reality. Resident Choreographer Wayne McGregor leads a luminous artistic team to evoke Woolf’s signature stream of consciousness writing style in this immense work that rejects traditional narrative structures. Woolf Works is a collage of themes from Mrs Dalloway, Orlando, The Waves and Woolf’s other writings. Created in 2015 for The Royal Ballet, this Olivier-award winning ballet triptych captures the heart of Woolf’s uniquely artistic spirit.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"Virginia Woolf defied literary conventions to depict rich inner worlds – her heightened, startling and poignant reality. \",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"0000000010\",\"censorRatingNote\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2026-02-09\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":210,\"trailerUrl\":null,\"displayPriority\":50,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000484\",\"roles\":[\"Director\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000028\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"e2b3d558-1b94-4d0b-8d50-0ba2acf543ec\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00007276\",\"hoCode\":\"A000008282\",\"eventId\":\"0000000001\",\"distributorName\":\"Trafalgar Releasing Ltd\"},{\"id\":\"HO00008356\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"Stray Kids: The dominATE Experience\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"Featuring the global K-Pop sensation Stray Kids and a live performance from their record-breaking world tour, alongside exclusive behind-the-scenes footage and intimate interviews with the band, Stray Kids: The dominATE Experience is an epic concert film that gives fans both a spectacular front-row seat and unique access to their favourite